flowchart TD
    S[Local PNG / JPEG / multi-page PDF + explicit metadata] --> T[Hash-verified private snapshot]
    T --> P[Every physical page]
    P --> V[Google Vision OCR adapter: sync / async]
    K[GOOGLE_VISION_API_KEY if nonblank<br/>otherwise Application Default Credentials] --> V
    V --> R[Raw response + all blocks + polygons + confidence]
    R --> C[Atomic raw OCR checkpoint when enabled]
    R --> Q[Whole-page reconstruction and cleanup request]
    Q --> I[Shared inference: sync / async logical batches]
    I --> F[Remove optional whole-response JSON fence]
    F --> A[Validate JSON schema and nonblank ad text]
    A -->|valid| B[Cleaned ads + full-page raw text<br/>Page provenance only; review required]
    A -->|invalid / failed| E[Checkpoint failure and stop later batches]
    E -. explicit resume: isolated EDSL cache .-> I
    B --> O[Verify persistent destination ownership]
    O --> J[Atomic outcomes/CSV per batch or on completion]
    J --> H[Human scan comparison / inspection<br/>CSV uses ocr_request_id and ocr_model_config_id]
    H --> D[Existing DatasetLoader]
    C -. compatible resume .-> Q
    J -. skip successful pages .-> Q
